      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "CMS Page Builder & Visual Reordering",
      "items": [
        "AdminPageBuilder supports Classic Layout vs Multi-Slide Carousel modes with custom mobile aspect ratios.",
        "ItemOrderSorting leverages @dnd-kit/core and @dnd-kit/sortable for touch-friendly menu reordering.",
        "Bulk sortOrder and layout updates persist to /api/page-config and /api/updateProductSortOrder in atomic batches."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Cloudinary Media Pipeline & Unused Audit",
      "items": [
        "Singleton guard validates env credentials before cloudinary.config() to prevent runtime poisoning.",
        "uploadToCloudinaryWithRetry handles ETIMEDOUT / ECONNRESET with 90s exponential backoff.",
        "Search API 20s Promise.race timeout falls back to Admin Resources API seamlessly.",
        "/api/media-usage audits all collections to identify and safely delete unused image assets."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Catalog Operations & Bulk Discounts",
      "items": [
        "Category-level bulk discount controls apply instant percentage or fixed-price promotions.",
        "Real-time UI feedback with optimistic updates and error rollback on network failures.",
        "Persistent ISR revalidation ensures public storefront updates immediately upon admin save."
      ]
    }
